{"id":"habilidad","lemma":"habilidad","pos":"noun","rank":1832,"glosses":["ability, skill"],"ipa":"/abiliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"habilidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-habilidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esta tarea requiere habilidad.","en":"This task requires dexterity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705400"},{"text":"Tus habilidades de negociación no son malas.","en":"Your negotiation skills aren't bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804220"},{"text":"Realmente confió en su habilidad.","en":"I really trust his ability.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581695"},{"text":"Él no tiene las habilidades para llevar bien ese trabajo.","en":"He doesn't have the necessary skills for that job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65202"},{"text":"Él tiene la habilidad de hacer buenos planes.","en":"He has the ability to make a good plan.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932187"}]}